s results in overworking herself to the point of collapsing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a total of 12 potential love interests, although this number increases in the After Season games due to the introduction of new characters and the ability to date minor characters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Starry☆Sky Wikia"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsukiko is drawn without eyes in the original Starry☆Sky. After the release of After series and all game releases, player have the option to have Tsukiko's eyes included in CGs or not."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4788"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56442d5ec2d3d139ee3fa7ce0cfcb83a11c0827d0445725cce9141550cdd0b55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a6b3d37e06d6198ec9f8d50605237831f4813355a655dfdd2459b0d564eeb45f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4802","characterName":"天羽 翼","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4802"},"originalCharacterName":"天羽 翼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"203"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"185"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsubasa represents the Aquarius. He's the moodmaker of the group. He has been living with his grandparents since he was little and loves inventing crazy things. He has a habit of coming up with nicknames for everybody."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4802"}],"profil